Step by step to use velocity control:

1. Create the motor: motor = new Motor(hardwareMap, "motor");

2. Set the run mode: motor.setRunMode(RunMode.VelocityControl);

3. Set coefficients: motor.setVeloCoefficients(kP, kI, kD); and motor.setFeedforwardCoefficients(kS, kV);

4. Drive: motor.set(0.5) means "run at 50% of max velocity"

5. Read speed: motor.getCorrectedVelocity() returns actual velocity in ticks/sec

The controller runs internally. You just need the right constants.
